          </p>

          <p>
            I am especially interested in projects where design and
            culture meet. Music, advertising, film and fashion are
            areas that inspire me because visual communication plays
            such a large role in how a brand, artist or story is
            experienced.
          </p>

          <p>
            My way of working is both creative and structured. I like
